        step("Act: Join correctness, bootstrap/boot and retained parser/dynload measurements into per-host certification.")
        step("Check: Windows, WSL and other host evidence remain separate; every claimed cell has its own required receipts and selected-budget comparisons; missing evidence stays open rather than PASS/N/A; no new boot-time budget is invented.")
        fail("NOT_IMPLEMENTED S7-I01-AC08: certify each claimed host with its own retained budgets")
